  "notable_quotes": [
    "Incorporating 3-substituted triazoles subtly changes Zn-triazolate layers and yields self-penetrated frameworks instead of the common 6-connected pcu nets.",
    "The longer-pillar framework 2 has higher solvent-accessible volume than 1, increasing from 27.8% to 45.6%.",
    "Replacing H2bdc with longer H2azdc enlarges channel openings and interlayer spacing; channel sizes increase from 12.7×6.4 to 18.2×6.9 Å2."
